Um, if you cannot afford to have your pet taken care of, you should not buy a pet.

00:00:18.190 --> 00:00:24.329
'You don't like animals; you're an animal hater!' No, I'm an animal lover. I have two dogs.

00:00:24.970 --> 00:00:31.470
We just lost one a while back, and got us back down to two. Our pug went to heaven.

00:00:32.169 --> 00:00:34.499
And all pugs, go to heaven, of course. And

00:00:36.520 --> 00:00:41.639
we have a Shih Tzu and we have a golden retriever. The golden retriever can actually talk, um,

00:00:42.790 --> 00:00:50.219
better than some of you. We love our pets. They are wonderful. They are, however, dogs and

00:00:51.879 --> 00:00:57.389
we have a reasonable economic outlook on them as animals. They are not humans.

00:00:58.210 --> 00:01:02.009
We love them. I always cry when one of them leaves.

00:01:02.920 --> 00:01:08.070
I cry like a thirteen-year-old girl watching Romeo and Juliet when the dogs leave.

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:13.080
I just bawl. I love my little pets, but they are dogs.

00:01:13.990 --> 00:01:15.990
