companions... If

00:02:16.840 --> 00:02:23.190
you're, you know, a single person, or you're, you're widowed or something, and, and, you know, your cat or your dog it's,

00:02:23.190 --> 00:02:28.139
it's one of your best friends. I get that. But you have to use your brain about this stuff, and

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:31.800
sometimes folks don't. And so, you know,

00:02:32.410 --> 00:02:38.639
you know. 'Well, you're a multi-millionaire, you wouldn't spend $10,000 on your dog?' I might... but I can afford it.

00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:42.030
An,-and, I kind of doubt it. You know...

